      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788016098322,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so at every index i, we need to check how many prefix exists such that there xor is (x^k) = y and that will be \nthe number of subarrays ending at index i having xor equal to k. Also after checking that increment the current \nprefix xor count in map",
      "fontSize": 74,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so at every index i, we need to check how many prefix exists such that there xor is (x^k) = y and that will be \nthe number of subarrays ending at index i having xor equal to k. Also after checking that increment the current \nprefix xor count in map",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
